# 🩸 BLOODBRIDGE — MEDITECH

## Real-Time AI-Assisted Blood & Platelet Rapid Response System

BLOODBRIDGE is a real-time healthcare coordination platform designed to help hospitals, donors, and healthcare staff manage urgent blood and platelet requirements.

The system connects hospitals with donors and blood banks, supports real-time communication, provides AI-assisted request processing, and maintains secure healthcare data management.

---

# 🚨 Problem Statement

During medical emergencies, hospitals may face difficulty in quickly finding the required blood group or platelet component.

Traditional processes can involve:

- Manual phone calls
- Delayed donor identification
- Difficulty tracking urgent requests
- Lack of real-time communication
- Unorganized emergency data
- Difficulty coordinating multiple hospitals and donors

BLOODBRIDGE aims to provide a centralized digital platform for faster emergency blood and platelet coordination.

---

# 💡 Proposed Solution

BLOODBRIDGE provides a production-ready, scalable architecture containing:

- Hospital and staff access
- Donor access
- Mobile/Web client support
- API Gateway
- Microservices
- Real-time WebSocket communication
- Redis caching and Pub/Sub
- Background workers
- AI parsing and assistance
- Asynchronous message processing
- PostgreSQL + PostGIS database
- Secure authentication and authorization
- Database migrations
- Monitoring and observability

